# Koh, the Face Stealer (CR 607.2a, 613.1f, 603.10a, 610.3): Bot2's Shock kills its own Doomed Traveler on turn 4 and Bot1 accepts Koh's
# "you may exile it". On turn 5 Bot1 pays 1 life to choose it, and Koh has "When this creature dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit
# creature token with flying" as its own. Bot2's Terminate kills Koh on turn 6: the granted ability triggers from Koh as it was (a
# leaves-the-battlefield ability looks back), so Bot1, Koh's controller, gets the Spirit, not Bot2 (the Traveler's owner), and the
# card stays exiled: Koh's exile of a dying creature lasts after Koh has gone.

